ea":"Economics and Public Finance","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"J000301","district":null,"fullName":"Rep. Johnson, Dusty [R-SD-At Large]","party":"R","state":"SD"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-09-23","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Eliminate Shutdowns Act</strong></p><p>This bill provides continuing appropriations to prevent a government shutdown if the appropriations bills for a fiscal year have not been enacted before the fiscal year begins and continuing appropriations are not in effect.</p><p>Specifically, the bill provides appropriations at the rate of operations that was provided for the prior fiscal year to continue programs, projects, and activities that were funded in the preceding fiscal year.</p>","updateDate":"2025-10-06T17:46:00Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Eliminate Shutdowns Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-08T19:31:27Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-08T19:31:27Z"}
